WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Crouching heavy punch starts the route.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.800
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.550
Luke dashes toward Ryu before activating level two.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:07.950
Eraser starts beneath the falling Ryu.

5
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.250
Eraser sends Ryu away at the end of its sequence.

6
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.100
Ryu lands after the level-two juggle.
